    "detailed_description": "Step into &quot;The Inner Descent&quot;, a VR horror-adventure game that delves deep into the realms of the subconscious, presenting a haunted forest echoing with the whispers of lurking shadows, a manifestation of fear and the unknown.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour purpose in this wilderness is simple yet challenging: to escape. Your resources are symbolic keys, each color-coded to reflect different personal strides towards liberation. Venture through the forest and its enigmatic buildings, each room resonating with the echoes of your deepest fears and unresolved emotions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;The Inner Descent&quot; blends psychological horror with introspective storytelling, transcending traditional genre boundaries. It's more than just surviving; it's about understanding, evolving, and unearthing the secrets within. With a dynamic gameplay loop that changes with each playthrough, every journey into the forest is a new adventure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDare to step into the unknown, decipher the mysteries, and unlock your path to liberation. Will you survive The Inner Descent?",
    "about_the_game": "Step into &quot;The Inner Descent&quot;, a VR horror-adventure game that delves deep into the realms of the subconscious, presenting a haunted forest echoing with the whispers of lurking shadows, a manifestation of fear and the unknown.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour purpose in this wilderness is simple yet challenging: to escape. Your resources are symbolic keys, each color-coded to reflect different personal strides towards liberation. Venture through the forest and its enigmatic buildings, each room resonating with the echoes of your deepest fears and unresolved emotions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;The Inner Descent&quot; blends psychological horror with introspective storytelling, transcending traditional genre boundaries. It's more than just surviving; it's about understanding, evolving, and unearthing the secrets within. With a dynamic gameplay loop that changes with each playthrough, every journey into the forest is a new adventure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDare to step into the unknown, decipher the mysteries, and unlock your path to liberation. Will you survive The Inner Descent?",
    "short_description": "&quot;The Inner Descent&quot; is a VR horror-adventure. Survive a haunting forest, explore eerie buildings, and evade lurking fears. Find keys to unlock your escape in this replayable journey. Will you conquer your inner self?",
